PDL-Filter-Biquad version 0.01
==============================

This module implements a digital biquad filter, in a restricted way
which is needed for a project by the author.

INSTALLATION

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

This module requires these other modules and libraries:

  Perl 5.26 or newer
  PDL version version 2.096 or newer
  Carp (part of the Perl core)
  Scalar::Util (part of the Perl core)
  Test::More  version 0.88 or newer (part of the Perl core)

